    <section id="tab1" class="pd-tab-pane active" role="tabpanel">
<div class="pd-section"><h3>Overview</h3>
        <p>Aviation insurance covers <strong>aircraft hull (physical damage), passenger and third-party liability, cargo and ground / hangar exposures</strong>. It spans commercial airlines, business and corporate aircraft, helicopters, emerging UAM and aviation-parts manufacturers.</p></div>
      <div class="pd-section"><h3>Key features</h3>
        <ul class="pd-feature-list">
          <li><span class="pd-num">01</span><div class="pd-ftext"><strong>Hull + liability + cargo</strong>
            <p>Physical damage, liability and cargo under one programme.</p></div></li>
          <li><span class="pd-num">02</span><div class="pd-ftext"><strong>Passenger &amp; third-party</strong>
            <p>Liability to passengers and third parties on the ground and in the air.</p></div></li>
          <li><span class="pd-num">03</span><div class="pd-ftext"><strong>UAM / corporate aircraft</strong>
            <p>Cover for corporate fleets, helicopters and urban air mobility.</p></div></li>
          <li><span class="pd-num">04</span><div class="pd-ftext"><strong>Products &amp; hangar</strong>
            <p>Hangarkeepers and aviation-products liability for manufacturers / MRO.</p></div></li>
        </ul></div>
      <div class="pd-section"><h3>Who needs it</h3>
        <ul class="pd-feature-list">
          <li><span class="pd-num">01</span><div class="pd-ftext"><strong>Airlines &amp; operators</strong>
            <p>Commercial air carriers and charter operators.</p></div></li>
          <li><span class="pd-num">02</span><div class="pd-ftext"><strong>Corporate aircraft</strong>
            <p>Business and corporate aircraft owners.</p></div></li>
          <li><span class="pd-num">03</span><div class="pd-ftext"><strong>Helicopter &amp; UAM</strong>
            <p>Helicopter and urban-air-mobility operators.</p></div></li>
          <li><span class="pd-num">04</span><div class="pd-ftext"><strong>Manufacturers &amp; MRO</strong>
            <p>Aviation-parts makers and maintenance organisations.</p></div></li>
        </ul></div>
    </section>
    <section id="tab2" class="pd-tab-pane" role="tabpanel">
<div class="pd-section"><h3>Main losses covered</h3>
        <ul class="pd-bul">
          <li>Aircraft hull physical damage</li>
          <li>Passenger and third-party legal liability</li>
          <li>Cargo and hangarkeepers / ground exposures</li>
          <li>Aviation products liability for manufacturers</li>
        </ul></div>
      <div class="pd-section"><h3>Main endorsements</h3>
        <ul class="pd-feature-list">
          <li><span class="pd-num">01</span><div class="pd-ftext"><strong>War / hijack</strong>
            <p>Hull and liability war, hijack and confiscation perils.</p></div></li>
          <li><span class="pd-num">02</span><div class="pd-ftext"><strong>Spares &amp; equipment</strong>
            <p>Spare parts and ground equipment cover.</p></div></li>
          <li><span class="pd-num">03</span><div class="pd-ftext"><strong>UAM / drone</strong>
            <p>Tailored cover for UAM and unmanned aircraft.</p></div></li>
        </ul></div>
      <div class="pd-exclude"><h4>Main exclusions</h4>
        <ul>
          <li>Wear, tear and gradual deterioration</li>
          <li>Operation outside airworthiness or by unlicensed crew</li>
          <li>Illegal use and operation outside agreed geographic limits</li>
          <li>War and nuclear perils unless specifically endorsed</li>
          <li>Pre-existing damage and known defects</li>
        </ul></div>
    </section>
    <section id="tab3" class="pd-tab-pane" role="tabpanel">
<div class="pd-section"><h3>Conditions &amp; process</h3>
        <ul class="pd-bul">
          <li>Underwriting reflects aircraft type, use, crew and routes</li>
          <li>Hull and liability limits are set per aircraft and per occurrence</li>
          <li>War and UAM covers are arranged with specialist capacity</li>
        </ul></div>
      <div class="pd-section"><h3>What we need to quote</h3>
        <ul class="pd-feature-list">
          <li><span class="pd-num">01</span><div class="pd-ftext"><strong>Aircraft schedule</strong>
            <p>Type, value and year of each aircraft.</p></div></li>
          <li><span class="pd-num">02</span><div class="pd-ftext"><strong>Usage</strong>
            <p>Commercial, corporate, training or UAM use.</p></div></li>
          <li><span class="pd-num">03</span><div class="pd-ftext"><strong>Crew</strong>
            <p>Crew experience and licensing.</p></div></li>
          <li><span class="pd-num">04</span><div class="pd-ftext"><strong>Routes &amp; limits</strong>
            <p>Geographic limits and the hull / liability limits required.</p></div></li>
        </ul></div>
      <div class="pd-section"><h3>Other notes</h3>
        <ul class="pd-bul">
          <li>Specialist aviation capacity may apply to certain risks</li>
          <li>Final terms and premium are confirmed after insurer underwriting</li>
        </ul></div>
    </section>

